File name: DRESLOOP.MP
Path description: Black Fortress
Path starts: Dreary Shop
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Original Game
Level recommendation: 25-35
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: guard captain, dark assassin, dark mage, dark priest,
                      dark warrior, dark cleric, black cultist (hard ones).
Additional information:

This loop is designed for people who want to collect money, because it
goes out to the dreary shop, buys and sells a Kher grass (very cheap),
which makes your coins be converted into the largest possible currency
(eg, if you have 100 gold, buy and sell a Kher grass, you will then have
1 plat).

